          "notes_base": "Well-reviewed boutique hotel (4.7 stars on Gaode) inside Datong ancient city walls, 722m walk to Huayan Temple (华严寺). Double room ~200-350 CNY/night. ~10 min taxi from Datong Railway Station (大同站). Excellent location for exploring the ancient city on foot: Huayan Temple, Dai Prince Palace (代王府), city walls. Newer-style boutique property in the historic East Gate district.",
          "notes_local": "高评分精品酒店（高德4.7星），位于大同古城墙内，步行722米可达华严寺。标准双人间约200-350元/晚。距大同火车站约10分钟车程。地理位置绝佳，步行可达华严寺、代王府、古城墙。位于古城东关历史文化区的精品酒店。",
