          "notes_base": "Moxy Xi'an South (碑林太乙路) — Marriott brand boutique design hotel, ~275-304 CNY/night. 大众点评必住榜 hotel. Located in Beilin District inside the ancient city area, ~10 min walk to Bell Tower (钟楼), City Wall south gate, Muslim Quarter (回民街). Standout breakfast with Shaanxi specialties (凉菜, sweet rice, lotus leaf pork, etc.). Young, energetic design with 24hr gym and self-service laundry. Book via Marriott Bonvoy or Ctrip. Matilde solo arrival on May 10.",
          "notes_local": "西安莫克西酒店（碑林太乙路店）——万豪旗下精品设计酒店，约275-304元/晚。大众点评必住酒店。位于碑林区古城核心区，步行约10分钟可达钟楼、城墙南门和回民街。早餐品质极高，含陕西特色（凉菜、甜米、荷叶饼粉蒸肉等）。酒店风格年轻有活力，配有24小时健身房和自助洗衣房。可通过万豪或携程预订。Matilde于5月10日单独入住。",
          "image_url": "https://store.is.autonavi.com/showpic/6e0d754d05eb7feb3010ec1327b80cad"
